{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill and reflexes in Ship v Maze, the ultimate test of spatial awareness! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your sleek spaceship through complex and challenging mazes. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have two options: turn left or turn right. There's no acceleration, no braking, just pure, unadulterated navigation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and strive for improvement. Every run is a chance to beat your previous score and delve deeper into the treacherous labyrinth. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the challenge, hone your skills, and see how far you can go in this addictive experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113380?t=1767820574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113380?t=1767820574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113380/7e1225abbdd75ef2a01ce3e8f9b734ebe585e3e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767820574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113380/7e1225abbdd75ef2a01ce3e8f9b734ebe585e3e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767820574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4177290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill and reflexes in Ship v Maze, the ultimate test of spatial awareness! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your sleek spaceship through complex and challenging mazes. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas